  "description": "This flexible and reusable file upload module provides a comprehensive solution for uploading files across various destinations, \n\t   including Azure Blob Storage, local folders, and NAS drives. The module supports both synchronous and asynchronous upload operations,\n\t   ensuring performance optimization for both small and large files.\n\n\t\tKey Features:\n\t\tDynamic and Configurable Destinations: Easily configure upload destinations such as Azure Blob Storage, local file system, or NAS drives.\n\t\tFlexible Validation: Configurable validation for file formats (MIME types) and file sizes, ensuring compliance with your requirements.\n\t\tSupport for Large File Uploads: Handles large file uploads efficiently in bytes, with support for chunked uploads for large files.\n\t\tAsynchronous and Synchronous Upload Options: Choose between synchronous and asynchronous upload methods based on application requirements.\n\t\tExtensible and Reusable: Built for flexibility, this module is fully configurable, allowing seamless integration into any .NET application.",
